verify.body:
Open this link to confirm your email. Your trial starts with the confirmation:
{link}

The link is valid for {hours}. If you did not sign up for Korpora, do not open the link — an unconfirmed account is deleted after {days}.

alreadyRegistered.body:
Someone tried to sign up for a new account with this email, but you already have one.

Sign in: {login}
Forgot password: {reset}

If it was not you, there is nothing you need to do.

reset.body:
To set a new password, open this link:
{link}

The link is valid for {hours} and works once. If you did not ask for a new password, do nothing — your old one stays.

invite.body:
The Korpora team has created an account for you with this email. To sign in, set your password with this link:
{link}

The link is valid for {hours} and works once; if it expires, ask for a new one under “Forgot password”: {reset}

If you were not expecting this account, do not open the link and write to us at the address below.

newDevice.body:
A new device has signed in to your account.

When: {when}
Device: {device}
IP: {ip}
Country: {country}

If it was you, there is nothing you need to do. If not, change your password and end the other sessions: {security}

changeEmail.body:
To change your account's email to this address, open the link:
{link}

The link is valid for {hours}. Until you open it, you sign in with the old email.

planChanged.body:
Your plan is now {plan}.
Valid until: {until}

Account: {account}

banned.body:
We have blocked access to your Korpora account: you cannot sign in, and all sessions have been ended.

Reason: {reason}

Basis: the terms and conditions, sections “What is not allowed” and “Blocking”: {terms}
The decision was taken by a person on our team, not automatically.

If you think the blocking is a mistake, write to us at {contact} — we consider every objection and, if it is a mistake, we restore access. If you are a consumer, you can also turn to the Bulgarian Commission for Consumer Protection and its conciliation commissions for out-of-court settlement of the dispute (www.kzp.bg), or to the courts. You can ask for your data at the same address while the account is blocked.

